the 3D models and map data prepared for it, icons, images and promo videos - are the work of the copyright
holder. They are NOT open source and are NOT licensed for use by anyone else.

Without the copyright holder's prior written permission, you may not:
  - copy, reproduce, modify, adapt, translate or make derivative works of any part of it;
  - distribute, publish, host, mirror or sublicense any part of it;
  - use any part of it in another project, product, service or website.

Commercial use of any part of it is not permitted.

Any other use needs the copyright holder's consent first: ask before you use it, by opening an issue at
https://github.com/icebays/gps-hku/issues. Permission, if given, is given to you only, may come with conditions,
and covers only what it states.

You may use the website, and view this repository on GitHub as GitHub's Terms of Service allow.

Third-party material is not covered by the above and keeps its own terms:
  - three.js (MIT License), marked (MIT License) and jsQR (Apache License 2.0), in vendor/
  - 3D Spatial Data and 3D indoor maps: © Lands Department, HKSAR Government
  - map data: © OpenStreetMap contributors (Open Database License)
  - weather and warnings: Hong Kong Observatory
  - building and place information from HKU's campus map; eatery details and photos from HKU Catering Services
  - in the promo videos: sound effects from Mixkit (Mixkit License); fonts Noto Sans TC, Noto Serif TC and Inter
    (SIL Open Font License)

The website and its content are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

GPS-HKU is an unofficial student project and is not affiliated with The University of Hong Kong or the MTR
Corporation.

